  "investigation_notes": "Uploads failure investigation - evidence based:\n\n**Factual findings:**\n\n* App container `incidentlab-app-1` is `running` - `Up 5 seconds` [E1], `running:true`, `started_at 23:43:01` [E6].\n* But application `/health` is `503 {\"status\":\"unhealthy\"}` [E2].\n* Database container `incidentlab-db-1` is `exited` - `Exited (0) 2 seconds ago` [E1], `running:false`, `status:exited`, `exit_code:0`, `health:unhealthy` [E5].\n* DB `oom_killed:false`, `error:null`, `restart_count:0` [E5].\n* Events show DB was `health_status: healthy` then `pg_isready exit 0` repeatedly, then `kill/stop/die exit 0`, recreate, `start`, `health_status: healthy`, `app start`, then DB `kill/stop/die exit 0` at `23:43:03` [E4].\n* App mount present: `bind source /srv/lab-data -> /data rw:true` [E6], app user `1000:1000` [E6].\n* Storage filesystem `/srv/lab-data`: `use_percent 9.0`, `available 410.7 MB`, `inode_use 0.2%` [E8] - not full.\n* Root filesystem `/`: `use_percent 6.8`, `inode_use 1.5%` [E9] - not full.\n* Upload dir `/srv/lab-data/uploads`: `is_dir:true`, `owner 1000:1000`, `mode 0755`, `app_uid 1000`, `app_user_can_write:true` [E10].\n* Parent `/srv/lab-data`: `is_dir:true`, `owner 1000:1000`, `mode 0755`, `app_user_can_write:true` [E11].\n* Container logs unavailable for app and db: `this data source is unavailable` [E3][E7][E12].\n\n**Interpretation:**\n\n* Storage causes ruled out: capacity [E8][E9] and writability [E10][E11] and mount [E6] are healthy.\n* OOM-kill ruled out for DB: `oom_killed:false` [E5].\n* Root cause vs symptom: App `503` [E2] is symptom. App itself is running [E1][E6]. Dependency `incidentlab-db-1` is stopped `exited` [E1][E5] after being `healthy` [E4]. Uploads depend on DB, so unhealthy app is expected with DB down.\n* Why DB stopped: `exit_code 0` clean exit [E1][E5], `kill/stop` in events [E4], not crash, `OOM false` [E5]. No log evidence to determine internal DB error vs external stop [E3][E7][E12].\n\n**Conclusion: `insufficient_evidence` for definitive internal DB failure reason, but evidence shows:**\nNo storage fault, App running but unhealthy due to dependency DB container being in `exited` state.\nRepairs require person approval - no changes made. Budget used 12/12.\n",
